|---|---|
| Downtime | none; the global secrets stay until you remove them |
| Cost | regional secrets are new items, small and I haven't verified the pricing. Both sets exist until step 4 |
| Reversible | steps 1–3 yes; step 4 no |
| Frontend | unaffected; its config is in the build, not in Secret Manager |

